  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Family house</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Care for HIV Positive children in three Family housesFamily houses are dedicated to care, serve orphaned, and HIV/AIDS positive children. A total number of 46 orphaned and HIV/AIDS positive children are residing in three family houses. Goal: The goal of the family houses is forming the children holistically, instilling hope and preparing to be independent and productive citizens.</narrative>
  </description>
